# What must not leave this machine in a deploy archive.
#
# Pxxl's own defaults already exclude `.git`, `node_modules`, `dist`, `build`, `.next`,
# `.turbo`, `.cache`, `*.log`, `.env`, `.env.*` and its own config, so this file is only
# for what this repository generates that the defaults do not name.

# A live bearer credential for the console, printed once by the operator path. It is
# gitignored, and it is the one file here that would be a security incident rather than
# a nuisance if it reached a container image.
.console-credential

coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Research and evidence artefacts, kept out of the repository for the same reason.
audit-export/
local-proofs/
.gstack/
